# sweep: --bare --seed-root apps/paperterm/fixtures/saved
# A reader with a saved pairing opens straight on the terminal and tries
# the computer, with no setup in the way.
wait-for Not connected
expect Pairing
# The computer confirmed this pairing on an earlier run, so the advice for a
# first pairing is not given again.
expect-missing reopen Cobalt once
expect-missing Terminal sessions
expect-missing Pair with your computer
clean
shot saved-opening
scenario offline
lifecycle background
lifecycle foreground
wait-for This Kobo is not on Wi-Fi.
clean
shot saved-offline
tap Pairing
wait-for Computer connection
expect laptop:9332
expect Pairing is saved for next time.
clean
shot saved-pairing-menu
tap Return to terminal
wait-for Not connected
# The top bar's back arrow leaves the Pairing menu too.
tap Pairing
wait-for Computer connection
tap-id 4294967295
wait-for Not connected
